{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_0", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_0.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "DRAMATIS PERSONAE", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Thomas Stockmann, Medical Officer of the Municipal Baths.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann, his wife.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (their daughter) a teacher.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Ejlif & Morten (their sons, aged 13 and 10 respectively).", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (the Doctor's elder brother), Mayor of the Town and Chief Constable, Chairman of the Baths' Committee, etc. Morten Kiil, a tanner (Mrs. Stockmann's adoptive father).", "para": 1, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad, editor of the \"People's Messenger.\"", "para": 1, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing, sub-editor.", "para": 1, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Captain Horster.", "para": 1, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen, a printer.", "para": 1, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Men of various conditions and occupations, a few women, and a troop of schoolboys\u2014the audience at a public meeting.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "The action takes place in a coastal town in southern Norway,", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "AN ENEMY OF THE PEOPLE", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "(SCENE.\u2014DR. STOCKMANN'S sitting-room.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "It is evening.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "The room is plainly but neatly appointed and furnished.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "In the right-hand wall are two doors; the farther leads out to the hall, the nearer to the doctor's study.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "In the left-hand wall, opposite the door leading to the hall, is a door leading to the other rooms occupied by the family.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "In the middle of the same wall stands the stove, and, further forward, a couch with a looking-glass hanging over it and an oval table in front of it.", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "On the table, a lighted lamp, with a lampshade.", "para": 5, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "At the back of the room, an open door leads to the dining-room.", "para": 5, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "BILLING is seen sitting at the dining table, on which a lamp is burning.", "para": 5, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "He has a napkin tucked under his chin, and MRS. STOCKMANN is standing by the table handing him a large plate-full of roast beef.", "para": 5, "sent": 9, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "The other places at the table are empty, and the table somewhat in disorder, evidently a meal having recently been finished.)", "para": 5, "sent": 10, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "You see, if you come an hour late, Mr. Billing, you have to put up with cold meat.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (as he eats).", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "It is uncommonly good, thank you\u2014remarkably good.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "My husband makes such a point of having his meals punctually, you know.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "That doesn't affect me a bit.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed, I almost think I enjoy a meal all the better when I can sit down and eat all by myself, and undisturbed.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh well, as long as you are enjoying it\u2014.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "(Turns to the hall door, listening.)", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "I expect that is Mr. Hovstad coming too.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Very likely.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETER STOCKMANN comes in.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "He wears an overcoat and his official hat, and carries a stick.)", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Good evening, Katherine.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (coming forward into the sitting-room).", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, good evening\u2014is it you?", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "How good of you to come up and see us!", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "I happened to be passing, and so\u2014(looks into the dining-room).", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "But you have company with you, I see.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (a little embarrassed).", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, no\u2014it was quite by chance he came in.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "(Hurriedly.)", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you come in and have something, too?", "para": 16, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "I!", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "No, thank you.", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Good gracious\u2014hot meat at night!", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Not with my digestion.", "para": 17, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, but just once in a way\u2014", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no, my dear lady; I stick to my tea and bread and butter.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "It is much more wholesome in the long run\u2014and a little more economical, too.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (smiling).", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Now you mustn't think that Thomas and I are spendthrifts.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Not you, my dear; I would never think that of you.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "(Points to the Doctor's study.)", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Is he not at home?", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "No, he went out for a little turn after supper\u2014he and the boys.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "I doubt if that is a wise thing to do.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "(Listens.)", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "I fancy I hear him coming now.", "para": 23, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I don't think it is he.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "(A knock is heard at the door.)", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in!", "para": 24, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD comes in from the hall.)", "para": 24, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, it is you, Mr. Hovstad!", "para": 24, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I hope you will forgive me, but I was delayed at the printers.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Good evening, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (bowing a little distantly).", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Good evening.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "You have come on business, no doubt.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Partly.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "It's about an article for the paper.", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "So I imagined.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "I hear my brother has become a prolific contributor to the \"People's Messenger.\"", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, he is good enough to write in the \"People's Messenger\" when he has any home truths to tell.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (to HOVSTAD).", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "But won't you\u2014?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "(Points to the dining-room.)", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so, quite so.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't blame him in the least, as a writer, for addressing himself to the quarters where he will find the readiest sympathy.", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "And, besides that, I personally have no reason to bear any ill will to your paper, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "I quite agree with you.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Taking one thing with another, there is an excellent spirit of toleration in the town\u2014an admirable municipal spirit.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "And it all springs from the fact of our having a great common interest to unite us\u2014an interest that is in an equally high degree the concern of every right-minded citizen.", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "The Baths, yes.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Exactly\u2014-our fine, new, handsome Baths.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Mark my words, Mr. Hovstad\u2014the Baths will become the focus of our municipal life!", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Not a doubt of it!", "para": 35, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "That is just what Thomas says.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Think how extraordinarily the place has developed within the last year or two!", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Money has been flowing in, and there is some life and some business doing in the town.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Houses and landed property are rising in value every day.", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "And unemployment is diminishing,", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is another thing.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "The burden on the poor rates has been lightened, to the great relief of the propertied classes; and that relief will be even greater if only we get a really good summer this year, and lots of visitors\u2014plenty of invalids, who will make the Baths talked about.", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "And there is a good prospect of that, I hear.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "It looks very promising.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "Inquiries about apartments and that sort of thing are reaching us, every day.", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 131, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, the doctor's article will come in very suitably.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 132, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 133, "kind": "action", "text": "Has he been writing something just lately?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 134, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 135, "kind": "action", "text": "This is something he wrote in the winter; a recommendation of the Baths\u2014an account of the excellent sanitary conditions here.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 136, "kind": "action", "text": "But I held the article over, temporarily.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}